  README.md,project,Current supported release and validation commands
close_reason: "Verified native pm 2026.8.7 compatibility against the official SDK, fresh and mature trackers, and all package quality gates."
body: Start with black-box differential fixtures and packaged contract inspection. Do not widen the CLI surface until current read/create bytes are re-proven. Caller-carried output sessions and attribution analytics from 2026.8.7 require separate vertical items unless their public contracts are both stable and necessary to the supported slice.
